+Verified by RunReady proof `e9795893-e9c6-466d-aedd-f2c542c8bec6` against https://gitlab.com/antonyvo/koreader-library-gui.
+
+`bash scripts/agent-check` runs the commands that passed on a clean checkout.
+
+```sh
+make zip VERSION=0.3.0
+luajit spec/run.lua
+```
